      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By 1900 Carmine boasted four general stores, four saloons, two blacksmith shops, a newspaper, several churches, and ten other businesses.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
